    description: "Swift web framework route patterns not matching: Vapor/Hummingbird YAML patterns use name regex like 'app.get' but Swift analyzer extracts qualified names (RoutesBuilder.get or bare 'get'). Routes.txt is empty for all 8 Swift bakeoff repos despite having patterns configured. Identified by DEEP bakeoff reflect assessment."  # 9204
