  by: agent  # ad86
  actor: jgstern_agent  # ad86
  clock: 3  # ad86
  nonce: ad86  # ad86
  message: "Investigation: framework detection IS working (101 concept-enriched nodes in Vapor: middleware, auth, dto). The gap is specifically route detection which requires usage-based patterns (UsageContext extraction not implemented for Swift). The definition-based patterns (base_class matching) work correctly. Downgrading to P4 since it's a substantial feature (Swift usage context extraction)."  # ad86
